The optimization library (library/) cites third-party works as evidence: papers, articles,
documentation and benchmark reports, each named with its authors and a link. Short quotations
from those works remain their authors' and are included for citation. library/vero-taxonomy.yaml
reproduces the edit taxonomies of VeRO (Scale AI, "VeRO: A Harness for Agents to Optimize
Agents", https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.22480), and library/library.yaml lists the sources of VeRO's
pattern library.

